227	    /**
228	     * Generate a customer code formatted {@code <LAST3>-<NNNN>}, where {@code LAST3} is the
229	     * upper-cased first three letters of {@code lastName} and {@code NNNN} is a global 4-digit
230	     * zero-padded sequence equal to one more than the current number of owners (e.g. {@code SMI-0007}).
231	     *
232	     * @param lastName the owner's last name
233	     * @return the generated customer code
